SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration (Sotiros)\, Christos Raches
LOCATION:Christos Raches\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Christos Rachon throws one of the two biggest panigiria on Ikaria\, for the Transfiguration. The mountain village fills with thousands and the proceeds fund the village all year — school\, roads\, the clinic. The dancing routinely runs until 7am.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#christos-raches-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-chri
